#: crates/opencrt/ui/main.slint:3850
msgid ""
"Key = what it does, e.g. F5 = show running-config\\r, Ctrl+K = menu: clear-"
"screen, Alt+F1 = run: wireshark. Keys: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, "
"Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space or a character (with Ctrl or Alt), plus "
"Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+. Text is sent (\\r is Enter); or script: file, menu: "
"command, run: program, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop. Sessions can add "
"their own (Session Options > Keyboard)."
msgstr "Näppäin = mitä se tekee, esim. F5 = show running-config\\r, Ctrl+K = menu: clear-screen, Alt+F1 = run: wireshark. Näppäimet: F1-F24, Up, Home, PageUp, Insert, Delete, Tab, Enter, Escape, Space tai merkki (Ctrl- tai Alt-näppäimen kanssa), sekä Ctrl+ Alt+ Shift+. Teksti lähetetään (\\r on Enter); tai script: tiedosto, menu: komento, run: ohjelma, telnet: brk|ayt|ip|ao|ec|el|ga|nop. Istunnot voivat lisätä omiaan (Istunnon asetukset > Näppäimistö)."

